* The bound of ` scanF ` at the machine (~ tmiscfa ): the prologue ( ` 4 TMB b ` ), the loop ( ` 64 TMB U ` per unit of scan cost, ` U = 12 ( # Q + 1 ) ( bq + b ) + # Q + 24 ` ) and the epilogue ( ` 3 TMB b ` ) fit Lean's ` ( c + 1 ) TMB ( 48 ( # Q + 1 ) ( bq + b ) + 4 # Q + 102 ) ` : ` 64 TMB U = TMB ( 4 U + 6 ) ` (~ tplbscale ) and ` TMB b <_ TMB U ` (~ tmbmono ).

